  "evidence_limits": "1.4.0 adds a bounded experimental HMS subscription using the supplied native tool profile 0a->1d, 21/05 payload 01 and 21/06 data. Native header high-bit end and six-byte records are reconstructed statically; public OSDK is only a reference for record fields, not Mini 4 Pro compatibility or alarm descriptions. No automatic global unsubscribe/reset is sent, and subscription status after USB close is unknown. Synthetic tests and Wine cover fragmented/contradictory/incomplete cycles, codes/levels, errors, UI and ZIP. No physical HMS query or native Windows test was performed here. Two user-provided SN trials independently show four stable serials, without proving health or calibration."
